#
# Store every text file with LF in the repository and write LF into the
# working tree on every platform, regardless of a contributor's local
# core.autocrlf or core.eol setting. Binaries are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

### Repository-specific exceptions

# Recorded inputs and expected output. A converted line ending would change
# what the generator is compared against.
tests/fixtures/**                      -text
tests/unit/markdown_pipeline_golden.json -text

# Regenerate with uv lock, never merge.
uv.lock -merge
